      "source": "Access the <a href=\"../../server/ServerWebExchange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>ServerWebExchange</code></a> from a Reactor <code>ContextView</code>,\nif available, which is generally the case when\n<a href=\"ServerWebExchangeContextFilter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.filter.reactive\"><code>ServerWebExchangeContextFilter</code></a> is present in the filter chain.",
      "translation": "从 Reactor <code>ContextView</code> 访问 <a href=\"../../server/ServerWebExchange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>ServerWebExchange</code></a>（如果可用），通常当 <a href=\"ServerWebExchangeContextFilter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.filter.reactive\"><code>ServerWebExchangeContextFilter</code></a> 存在于过滤器链中时，这是可行的。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The convenience method <a href=\"#getExchange(reactor.util.context.ContextView)\"><code>getExchange(ContextView)</code></a> looks up the exchange.",
